## 5. Important Trade-offs

| Decision | Alternative Considered | Trade-off & Justification |
|---|---|---|
| **Docker containers** | Local `child_process.spawn` | Containers introduce ~100–250ms startup latency per execution compared to raw local processes. However, local processes have zero security isolation against malicious code. |
| **Docker containers** | Firecracker microVMs / gVisor | Firecracker or gVisor provide even stronger virtualization boundaries, but require complex bare-metal Linux hypervisors. Docker is practical, portable across developer environments (Windows, macOS, Linux), and standard for SDE portfolio projects. |
| **Pre-built runner images** | Pulling generic images at runtime | Building dedicated `ocj-runner-*` images locally with non-root users ensures rapid container boot times and zero dependencies downloaded during a candidate's submission. |

